# seaward snapshot 1
# An invented gateway. Its rules are written in nftables by hand: a WireGuard tunnel, a LAN
# behind it, and two ports passed on to machines inside. The rules are a real "nft -j list
# ruleset" listing; the addresses are documentation addresses.
### meta
host edge-1
seaward 0.1.1
collector cli
root yes
